                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEME UND VERFAHREN ZUM TRAINIEREN VON MASCHINENMODELLEN MIT ERWEITERTEN DATEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES ET PROCÉDÉS D'APPRENTISSAGE DE MODÈLES DE MACHINE À L'AIDE DE DONNÉES AUGMENTÉES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS AND METHODS FOR TRAINING MACHINE MODELS WITH AUGMENTED DATA</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method comprises: identifying, by a processor, a set of images captured by a set of cameras associated with a vehicle; for an image that depicts an object within the set of images, generating, by the processor, an augmented image by modifying a visual element of the image; and training, by the processor, a predictive computer model using at least a portion of the set of images and the augmented image, wherein the trained predictive computer model is configured to predict a presence of the object in input images for use in autonomous or semi-autonomous control of vehicles.</p>
            </abstract>
